      '已运行 ' + pb.progress.age_days|string + ' 个交易日，对比 ' + pb.progress.n_history|string + ' 段过往同象限周期的中位数 ' + pb.progress.median_days|string + ' 个交易日。') }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if pb.next_list %}
  <div class="panel span6">
    <h2>{{ t("What's likely next", '接下来可能发生什么') }}
      {{ help("Across every same-quad period in this classifier, which regime came next. Base rates from a short, globally-sensitive history — not forecasts.", "本分类器中每段同象限周期之后接下来出现的周期。来自一段短而对全球敏感历史的基础概率 — 而非预测。") }}</h2>
