    <h2>{{ t('⏳ Regime time machine', '⏳ 周期时光机') }}
      {{ help("Drag the playhead across ~20 years of Hang Seng history and the readout rewinds the regime core to that day — quadrant, growth/inflation scores, agreement, dual liquidity and the cycle. Hit ▶ to watch the quad ribbon flip at every major turn — 2008 GFC, the 2015 rally, 2018, 2020 COVID, the 2021 HS-TECH peak.", "拖动播放头横扫约 20 年恒生历史，下方读数会把周期核心回退到那一天 — 象限、增长／通胀分数、一致度、双重流动性与周期。点击 ▶ 观看周期色带在每个重大转折处翻转 — 2008 金融危机、2015 行情、2018、2020 疫情、2021 恒生科技见顶。") }}
